#: ../../index.rst:893
msgid ""
"In forward-auth mode the p99.9 stays below 75 us up to 150,000 requests "
"per second. In reverse-proxy mode, with the origin in the path, the p99 "
"is 100 us and the p99.9 150 us at 100,000 requests per second. At 150,000 "
"requests per second in reverse-proxy mode the daemon is past its "
"capacity: it completes 134,344 requests per second, close to the 138,965 "
"that ``wrk`` measured for the same workload, and latency grows to "
"seconds, as an open-loop test should show above capacity. The four errors "
"of that row occurred in the overload [#latency]_."
